		(property "Description" "7-port USB 2.0 high-speed HUB, QFN-32 4x4mm. EP is datasheet pin 0 (GND, required), numbered 33 to match KiCad footprint - verify EP size vs datasheet 7.3. PWR_CTL/CFG strap at reset: 820R to GND enables 2-wire extension/isolation mode (Table 5-6). PWREN# active low, also PD-disable strap (built-in pull-up). AVDDK/DVDDK are internal core regulator outputs, decouple only."
